RISCV WRW+WR1
"Naive RVWMO lowering (scopes erased) of tests/litmus/ptx/imported/dat3m/Memalloy/WRW+WR1.litmus"
{
0:x5=x; 1:x5=x; 1:x6=y; 2:x5=x; 2:x6=y;
